# Changelog

All notable changes to the **Lucy Language** extension will be documented here.

## [1.0.0] - 2025-01-01

### Added
- Initial release
- Syntax highlighting for `.lucy` files
- Support for comments, strings, keywords, constants, numbers and operators
- Auto-closing pairs and surrounding pairs
- Function and class name highlighting
